# ═══ Layer 0: 错误面 (Error Surface) ═══
# trigger_tool: 出错的工具 (configure/cmake/meson/make/gcc/clang/ld/python/pip/install/test/runtime)
# phase:         出错阶段 (configuration/compilation/linking/installation/testing/runtime)
# error_signature: 正则表达式(|分隔), 用于精确匹配日志文本
id:                     E875
trigger_tool: test|runtime
phase: testing
error_signature: strcasecmp \(0\) and .*case_compare \(1\) differ|case comparison oracle differs on high bytes

# ═══ Layer 1: 识别层 (Recognition) ═══
# severity:      3=🔴blocking  2=🟡medium  1=🟢minor  0=✅resolved
# category:      分类标签（受控词表 64 词，逗号分隔，最多 5 个；add/promote 自动归一化）
# prescan_pattern: （可选）预编译源码扫描正则——写入后 PreScanner 运行时自动派生
#                   PSCAN-KB-{id} 规则，无需改 pre-scan-rules.yaml（知识增长即扫描能力增长）
# prescan_globs:   （可选）扫描范围 glob 列表，默认 '*.c, *.h, *.cc, *.cpp, *.sh, Makefile*, *.mk'
# 词表: platform, compat, limitation, detection, hmdfs, ohos, selinux, kernel, portability, libc, musl, posix, syscall, headers, threading, socket, network, build-system, cmake, autotools ...（全表见 scripts/ohc/kb_taxonomy.py）
# match_keywords: 纯文本关键词(逗号分隔), 用于粗筛(固定字符串匹配F)
# title:         简短标题(一句话描述错误模式)
severity:               2
category:               portability, libc, testing
match_keywords: strcasecmp, toupper, tolower, byte comparison, high bytes, C locale, test oracle
title: Separate byte-case API contracts from a native strcasecmp oracle on high bytes

# ═══ Layer 2: 诊断层 (Diagnosis) ═══
# root_cause:       一句话根因描述(逗号可分行)
# affected_scope:   影响范围
# verification_cmd: 验证诊断是否正确的命令
root_cause: A byte-oriented library folds unsigned octets with toupper, but its upstream test assumes native strcasecmp has identical ordering. On the current OHOS libc the original Latin-1 pair compares equal with strcasecmp while toupper/tolower preserve those high bytes. The test oracle contradicts the byte API, not proof that the library must adopt Unicode normalization. Autoconf creates config.status scratch directories in two branches with owner-only masks. On HMDFS, changing file modes later or repairing PR transport cannot establish creation-time access. Replace both creation branches with exclusive mkdir under the recipe-private TMPDIR, use umask 022 at creation, restore configure timestamps, and prefix TMPDIR after Conan environment activation. Preserve cleanup and every original test. Consumer compilation and consumer execution require different environment scopes. Use conanbuild for invoking the configured compiler and gw-config flags; activate conanrun only for the installed consumer execution. Mixing host runtime library directories into the SDK compiler process can select an incompatible libxml2 provider for lld.
affected_scope: Byte-oriented case-insensitive C libraries whose tests use native string comparison as an oracle for non-ASCII octets. Recheck actual locale and API contract; not Unicode text APIs, missing prototypes, or an actual faulty production comparison.
verification_cmd: Preserve all original high-byte inputs and pair counts; compare native strcasecmp and unsigned-byte ctype results; run full native upstream checks plus installed consumers with embedded NUL/high bytes.

# ═══ Layer 3: 方案层 (Solution Space) ★ ═══
# 推荐方案 (priority 越小越优先, 从 1 开始)
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: independent-byte-contract-oracle
rec_description: First prove the public API is unsigned-byte/ctype based and identify the active locale. Build independent explicit expected byte-fold ordering, retain all original input cases and comparisons, and limit the oracle change to the affected platform. Add installed binary-octet consumers; leave production algorithms unchanged when they satisfy their documented byte contract. Autoconf creates config.status scratch directories in two branches with owner-only masks. On HMDFS, changing file modes later or repairing PR transport cannot establish creation-time access. Replace both creation branches with exclusive mkdir under the recipe-private TMPDIR, use umask 022 at creation, restore configure timestamps, and prefix TMPDIR after Conan environment activation. Preserve cleanup and every original test. Consumer compilation and consumer execution require different environment scopes. Use conanbuild for invoking the configured compiler and gw-config flags; activate conanrun only for the installed consumer execution. Mixing host runtime library directories into the SDK compiler process can select an incompatible libxml2 provider for lld.
rec_command: python3 upstream_support/strict_checks.py sh
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: manual

# 回退方案 (当推荐方案不可用时尝试)
fallback_priority:      2
fallback_approach:
fallback_description:
fallback_command:
fallback_auto_fix:      false
fallback_impl:

# ★ 禁止策略 (与推荐方案同等重要) ★
# forbid_N_pattern:     正则(|分隔), 匹配则拒绝/警告
# forbid_N_reason:      为什么禁止
# forbid_N_consequence: 违反后的后果
forbid_1_pattern: Delete high-byte cases or accept native oracle mismatch as success
forbid_1_reason: This hides the contradiction rather than proving the library contract with an independent oracle.
forbid_1_consequence: False positive test pass and reduced original coverage.
# forbid_2_pattern:
# forbid_2_reason:
# forbid_2_consequence:

